ddf45b887d2bb2d89010cf215d6","type":"message","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"output_text","annotations":[],"logprobs":[],"text":"Double negations cancel, and triple negations reduce to a single negation. Let \\(X\\) denote an inner expression whose value is irrelevant.\n\n| Option | Decisive simplification | Value |\n|---|---|---|\n| A | \\(X\\land(-10-(-7/1)>4)=X\\land(-3>4)\\) | False |\n| B | \\(X\\lor(-10(-3)+5(4)>8(-2))=X\\lor(50>-16)\\) | **True** |\n| C | \\(X\\land\\neg\\neg(4(-5)>6)=X\\land(-20>6)\\) | False |\n| E | \\(X\\land\\text{False}\\) | False |\n\nFor **D**, evaluate its first top-level conjunct. Nepal’s capital is not Pokhara, and Malaysia’s capital is Kuala Lumpur. After cancelling double negations, this conjunct is\n\\[\n\\neg\\left(\n \\neg\\bigl(\\neg(F\\lor\\neg F)\\land(F\\lor\\neg F)\\bigr)\n \\land\n \\bigl((\\neg T\\land T)\\lor\\neg(F\\lor F)\\bigr)\n\\right).\n\\]\nHere the numerical comparisons reduce as follows:\n\\[\n-16>36:F,\\quad 60\\le9:F,\\quad -41\\le-20:T,\\quad 7\\le2:F,\\quad70\\le3:F.\n\\]\nThus the conjunct equals\n\\[\n\\neg\\bigl(\\neg(F\\land T)\\land(F\\lor T)\\bigr)\n=\\neg(T\\land T)=F.\n\\]\nTherefore D is false regardless of its remaining conjunct.\n\nFinal answer: **(B)**."}],"phase":"final_answer","role":"assistant"}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"presence_penalty":0,"previous_response_id":null,"prompt_cache_key":null,"prompt_cache_retention":"24h","reasoning":{"context":"all_turns","effort":"medium","mode":"standard","summary":null},"safety_identifier":null,"service_tier":"default","store":false,"temperature":1,"text":{"format":{"type":"text"},"verbosity":"medium"},"tool_choice":"auto","tool_usage":{"image_gen":{"input_tokens":0,"input_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"output_tokens":0,"output_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"total_tokens":0},"web_search":{"num_requests":0}},"tools":[],"top_logprobs":0,"top_p":0.98,"truncation":"disabled","usage":{"input_tokens":1225,